  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Uttarakhand Climate Resilient Power System Development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed Uttarakhand Power Transmission Strengthening and Distribution Improvement Project will expand the coverage and strengthen the capacity of the transmission network to improve the reliability of power supply to support the distribution network , better utilize the state&amp;apos;s indigenously available hydropower resources. It will developa disaster- and climate-resilient distribution system in the capital city of Uttarakhand. It will also support in developing community-based energy generation and livelihood opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
